  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WAV Project promotes national, regional, and local collaboration and networking among government and non-government organizations, allowing them to better implement sustainable interventions that address the needs and protect the human rights of people who have experienced SGBV, thereby advancing gender equality.</narrative>
